    pose proof HCODE as HC; cbn [code_at istrncpy_words Z.add Pos.add Pos.succ] in HC;
    destruct HC as (C0 & C4 & C8 & C12 & C16 & C20 & C24 & C28 & C32 & C36 & C40 & C44 & C48 & C52 & C56 & C60
